ounded-lg border border-white/70 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-white transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/register\">Ingresa al TEAM SAN</a></div></header><section class=\"flex flex-1 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm font-light uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/85\">Movilidad inteligente</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-light leading-[1.1] tracking-[0.06em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">Con San Mérida puedes ser<br/><span class=\"inline-flex min-h-[1.2em] items-end overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"animate-rise-fade inline-block\">Sueños realidad</span></span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-base font-light leading-7 tracking-[0.04em] text-white/85 sm:text-lg\">Creamos una experiencia premium para una marca moderna: limpia, elegante y lista para escalar a nivel empresarial.</p></div></section></div></section><section id=\"modelos\" class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-black px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mb-10 flex items-end justify-between\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-light tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-4xl\">Nuevos modelos</h2><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 md:flex\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/25 text-white/80 transition hover:border-white/60 hover:text-white\" aria-label=\"Modelo anterior\">←</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/25 text-white/80 transition hover:border-white/60 hover:text-white\" aria-label=\"Siguiente modelo\">→</button></div></div><div class=\"flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-6 overflow-x-auto scroll-smooth pb-3 [scrollbar-width:none] [-ms-overflow-style:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-model-card=\"true\" class=\"group min-w-[84%] snap-start rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-zinc-950/60 p-5