x]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-zinc-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 ease-out-cubic opacity-100 translate-x-0 rotate-y-0 z-20\"><div class=\"h-full flex flex-col md:flex-row\"><div class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-1/2 md:h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-black p-8 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/20 to-transparent\"></div><img alt=\"CONTACTO INICIAL\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-1000 scale-100 translate-y-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logominimal.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-zinc-950/80\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-white/5 font-mono select-none\">01</span><div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/10 mx-4\"></div></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white/50 tracking-widest mb-2\">ASESORÍA PERSONALIZADA</h3><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white mb-6\">CONTACTO INICIAL</h2><p class=\"text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">Inicia tu camino con una consulta directa. Nuestro equipo evalúa tu perfil y te guía hacia la mejor opción de financiamiento o compra directa.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/40 font-mono\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500/50 animate-pulse\"></span>SISTEMA ACTIVO</div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-zinc-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 ease-out-cubic opacity-0 translate-x-12 rotate-y-12 z-0\"><div class=\"h-full flex flex-col md:flex-row\"><div class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-1/2 md:h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-black p-8 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/20 to-transparent\"></div><img alt=\"REQUISITOS Y FIRMA\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-1000 scale-90 translate-y-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/ek-xpress-ii.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-zinc-950/80\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-white/5 font-mono select-none\">02</span><div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/10 mx-4\"></div></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white/50 tracking-widest mb-2\">FORMALIZACIÓN LEGAL</h3><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white mb-6\">REQUISITOS Y FIRMA</h2><p class=\"text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">Transparencia total. Consignas los documentos básicos, validamos tu elegibilidad y firmamos el contrato de participación con todas las garantías de ley.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/40 font-mono\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500/50 animate-pulse\"></span>SISTEMA ACTIVO</div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-zinc-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 ease-out-cubic opacity-0 translate-x-12 rotate-y-12 z-0\"><div class=\"h-full flex flex-col md:flex-row\"><div class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-1/2 md:h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-black p-8 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/20 to-transparent\"></div><img alt=\"INGRESO A RUEDA\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-1000 scale-90 translate-y-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/house-rl.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-zinc-950/80\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-white/5 font-mono select-none\">03</span><div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/10 mx-4\"></div></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white/50 tracking-widest mb-2\">SISTEMA ROTATIVO</h3><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white mb-6\">INGRESO A RUEDA</h2><p class=\"text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">Tu cupo es asignado en nuestra plataforma. Cada semana el sistema gira, acercándote a tu meta con tecnología auditada y resultados públicos.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/40 font-mono\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500/50 animate-pulse\"></span>SISTEMA ACTIVO</div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-zinc-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 ease-out-cubic opacity-0 translate-x-12 rotate-y-12 z-0\"><div class=\"h-full flex flex-col md:flex-row\"><div class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-1/2 md:h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-black p-8 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/20 to-transparent\"></div><img alt=\"ENTREGA DE UNIDAD\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-1000 scale-90 translate-y-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/Owen 200S.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-zinc-950/80\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-white/5 font-mono select-none\">04</span><div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/10 mx-4\"></div></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white/50 tracking-widest mb-2\">PROPIEDAD GARANTIZADA</h3><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white mb-6\">ENTREGA DE UNIDAD</h2><p class=\"text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">El momento final. Recibes tu motocicleta 0km con documentación a tu nombre, garantía de fábrica y el respaldo post-venta de San Mérida.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/40 font-mono\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500/50 animate-pulse\"></span>SISTEMA ACTIVO</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-10\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Dos sistemas, una meta</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">Llévate tu moto con el plan<br/>que mejor se adapte a ti.</h2><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Elige entre nuestro sistema SAN desde 55$ quincenales o un esquema de crédito tradicional. Ambos con acompañamiento experto, contratos claros y soporte post-venta.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)]\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-black text-sm font-semibold\">1</span><div><p class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/50\">Sistema SAN</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">55$ quincenales</h3></div></div><p class=\"text-base font-light leading-7 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/75\">Acceso al sistema rotativo SAN: eliges tu cupo, participas en la rueda y avanzas hasta la entrega. Incluye asistencia personalizada, seguimiento en tiempo real y transparencia en cada giro.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm text-white/60\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-3 py-1\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l3 3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></circle></svg>Rueda programada</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-3 py-1\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Seguimiento en vivo</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-3 py-1\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Contrato claro</span></div></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)]\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-black text-sm font-semibold\">2</span><div><p class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/50\">Sistema de crédito</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">Financia a tu ritmo</h3></div></div><p class=\"text-base font-light leading-7 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/75\">Opción de crédito con cuotas flexibles y aprobación guiada. Evaluamos tu perfil, definimos plazos cómodos y te acompañamos hasta la entrega final con respaldo post-venta.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm text-white/60\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-3 py-1\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Cuotas flexibles</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-3 py-1\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M7 12l3 3 7-7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Aprobación guiada</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-3 py-1\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 5v14m-7-7h14\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Plan a medida</span></div></article></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 items-start\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/80 p-3 shadow-[0_14px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between text-white/70 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M8 5l10 7-10 7V5z\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Sistema SAN</span></div><div class=\"group relative mx-auto aspect-[9/16] max-h-[300px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black\"><video class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"/sistemasan.mp4\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsInline=\"\" poster=\"/logominimal.png\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/15 transition duration-300 group-hover:bg-black/25\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_18%,rgba(255,255,255,0.14),transparent_55%)]\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-1/2 z-10 flex -translate-x-1/2 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-black/70 px-4 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/85 backdrop-blur-sm transition hover:border-white/50 hover:bg-black/80\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5l11 7-11 7V5z\"></path></svg>Vista previa</button></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/80 p-3 shadow-[0_14px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between text-white/70 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M8 5l10 7-10 7V5z\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Sistema Crédito</span></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto aspect-[9/16] max-h-[300px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/18 via-white/10 to-zinc-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-black shadow-lg shadow-black/60\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5l11 7-11 7V5z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-black/65 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/80\">Sube tu video</div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_18%,rgba(255,255,255,0.18),transparent_52%)]\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"nosotros\" class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Sobre Nosotros</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">San Mérida: confianza,<br/>trayectoria y crecimiento.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Somos una empresa enfocada en movilidad inteligente, con una propuesta profesional que combina modelos de alto valor, procesos transparentes y acompañamiento continuo para cada cliente.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"relative mb-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10]\"><img alt=\"Equipo y showroom San Mérida\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/new-house.jpeg\"/></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/55 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.03em] text-white\">Nuestra visión empresarial</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/75\">En San Mérida construimos relaciones a largo plazo. Nuestro objetivo es ofrecer planes claros, motocicletas confiables y una experiencia premium desde la asesoría inicial hasta la entrega final. Cada proceso está diseñado para brindar seguridad, respaldo y resultados reales.</p></article><div class=\"space-y-6\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light text-white\">Lo que nos distingue</h3><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-4 text-white/75\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></span><span>Planes SAN y crédito con asesoría personalizada.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></span><span>Proceso transparente con seguimiento en cada etapa.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></span><span>Catálogo en constante actualización con marcas y modelos estratégicos.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></span><span>Atención post-venta orientada a continuidad y fidelización.</span></li></ul></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light text-white\">En cifras</h3><div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-3 py-4 text-center\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">+10</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Modelos</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-3 py-4 text-center\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">2</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Sistemas</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-3 py-4 text-center\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">100%</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Enfoque</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"testimonios\" class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Testimonios</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">Historias reales de<br/>clientes San Mérida.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Resultados, confianza y acompañamiento profesional en cada entrega.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]\"><p class=\"text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/80\">“<!-- -->Desde el primer contacto sentí un trato serio y ordenado. El proceso fue claro y hoy ya tengo mi moto activa para trabajo diario.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><p class=\"text-lg font-light text-white\">Carlos Méndez</p><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/50\">Cliente SAN</p></div></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]\"><p class=\"text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/80\">“<!-- -->Me ayudaron a estructurar mis cuotas según mi flujo mensual. Todo fue transparente y el acompañamiento fue excelente.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><p class=\"text-lg font-light text-white\">Daniela Rivas</p><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/50\">Cliente Crédito</p></div></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]\"><p class=\"text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/80\">“<!-- -->San Mérida tiene una atención muy profesional. Cumplen lo que prometen y mantienen comunicación en cada etapa del proceso.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><p class=\"text-lg font-light text-white\">José Zambrano</p><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/50\">Cliente Recurrente</p></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-14\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/55\">Catálogo de videos</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-light text-white sm:text-3xl\">Contenido en movimiento</h3></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\"><div class=\"flex w-max will-change-transform animate-[videoMarquee_28s_linear_infinite]\" style=\"animation-play-state:paused\"><div c