<svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5l11 7-11 7V5z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/45 via-black/5 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">Video 05</p><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/60\"></span></div></article><article class=\"group relative min-w-[260px] max-w-[260px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-3 transition duration-300 hover:border-white/30\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[9/16] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black\"><video class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"none\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/35 bg-black/55 text-white backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5l11 7-11 7V5z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/45 via-black/5 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">Video 06</p><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/60\"></span></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"metodos-pago\" class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Métodos de pago</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">Elige cómo pagar<br/>de forma simple y segura.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Ofrecemos múltiples opciones para que completes tu compra con rapidez, transparencia y respaldo.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr]\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light text-white\">Pagos flexibles para cada cliente</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/75\">En San Mérida adaptamos el proceso a tu realidad: puedes pagar de forma nacional o internacional, digital o presencial, manteniendo siempre un proceso ordenado y profesional.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-3 py-4 text-center\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">4</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Métodos</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-3 py-4 text-center\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">24/7</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Atención</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-3 py-4 text-center\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">100%</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Seguro</p></div></div></article><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-4\"><div class=\"flex w-max gap-4 will-change-transform animate-[videoMarquee_20s_linear_infinite]\" style=\"animation-play-state:paused\"><div class=\"flex shrink-0 gap-4\"><article class=\"w-[170px] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 p-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-3 h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black\"><img alt=\"Binance\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-2\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/Binance.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/80\">Binance</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-white/55\">Cripto segura y rápida</p></article><article class=\"w-[170px] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 p-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-3 h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black\"><img alt=\"Pago Móvil\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-2\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/PagoMovil.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/80\">Pago Móvil</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-white/55\">Transferencia inmediata</p></article><article class=\"w-[170px] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 p-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-3 h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black\"><img alt=\"Zelle\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-2\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/Zelle.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/80\">Zelle</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-white/55\">Pagos internacionales</p></article><article class=\"w-[170px] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 p-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-3 h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black\"><img alt=\"Efectivo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-2\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/Efectivo.jpeg\"/></div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/80\">Efectivo</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-white/55\">Pago presencial directo</p></article><article class=\"w-[170px] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 p-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-3 h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black\"><img alt=\"Binance\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\