 p-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-3 h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black\"><img alt=\"Efectivo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-2\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/Efectivo.jpeg\"/></div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/80\">Efectivo</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-white/55\">Pago presencial directo</p></article></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 sm:p-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-center\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black p-6\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto h-28 w-full max-w-[260px]\"><img alt=\"Logo corporativo San Mérida\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/Logo.png\"/></div><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/55\">Identidad empresarial</p><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-white/70\">Marca enfocada en movilidad, confianza operativa y crecimiento sostenible.</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Propuesta de valor</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">Con San Mérida puedes hacer<br/>tus sueños realidad.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Diseñamos experiencias de compra con estructura empresarial: acompañamiento profesional, múltiples sistemas de adquisición, pagos flexibles y procesos transparentes que transforman metas personales en resultados reales.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/55 p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Asesoría</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-light text-white\">Personalizada</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/55 p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Procesos</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-light text-white\">Claros y seguros</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/55 p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Resultado</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-light text-white\">Entrega efectiva</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"ubicacion\" class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Ubicación real</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">Encuéntranos en Mérida,<br/>con mapa en tiempo real.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Integramos Google Maps para que llegues de forma directa, con referencia exacta y acceso inmediato a la ruta de navegación.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-4 sm:p-5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10\"><iframe title=\"Ubicación San Mérida\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=RQGQ%2B754%2C%20T%C3%A1riba%2C%20T%C3%A1chira&amp;output=embed\" class=\"h-[320px] w-full sm:h-[420px] lg:h-[500px]\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-4 py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Dirección</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-base font-light text-white/85\">RQGQ+754, Táriba, Táchira</p></div><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=RQGQ%2B754%2C%20T%C3%A1riba%2C%20T%C3%A1chira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white/85 transition hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/10\">Abrir en Google Maps<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"mb-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"relative mb-4 h-12 w-12 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-black\"><img alt=\"Logo San Mérida\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-1\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/logominimal.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/55\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.04em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">¿Tienes dudas?<br/>En San Mérida te las aclaramos.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Información clara para que tomes decisiones con seguridad y avances en tu proceso de compra sin fricción.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/60 px-5 py-4 transition duration-300 open:border-white/25\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-lg font-light text-white/90 marker:content-none\"><span>¿Cómo funciona el sistema SAN?</span><span class=\"text-white/50 transition group-open:rotate-45 group-open:text-white\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/70\">Te registras, eliges tu plan, validamos tus datos y participas en el proceso rotativo con acompañamiento profesional hasta la entrega de tu moto.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/60 px-5 py-4 transition duration-300 open:border-white/25\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-lg font-light text-white/90 marker:content-none\"><span>¿Qué necesito para iniciar el proceso?</span><span class=\"text-white/50 transition group-open:rotate-45 group-open:text-white\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/70\">Documento de identidad vigente, datos de contacto y la selección del modelo o plan. Nuestro equipo te guía en cada requisito según el sistema elegido.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/60 px-5 py-4 transition duration-300 open:border-white/25\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-lg font-light text-white/90 marker:content-none\"><span>¿Puedo financiar por crédito tradicional?</span><span class=\"text-white/50 transition group-open:rotate-45 group-open:text-white\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/70\">Sí. San Mérida ofrece opción de crédito con evaluación personalizada, cuotas adaptadas y seguimiento continuo hasta la formalización.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/60 px-5 py-4 transition duration-300 open:border-white/25\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-lg font-light text-white/90 marker:content-none\"><span>¿Cuáles métodos de pago aceptan?</span><span class=\"text-white/50 transition group-open:rotate-45 group-open:text-white\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/70\">Actualmente trabajamos con Binance, Pago Móvil, Zelle y efectivo, asegurando alternativas nacionales e internacionales para mayor comodidad.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/60 px-5 py-4 transition duration-300 open:border-white/25\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-lg font-light text-white/90 marker:content-none\"><span>¿Dónde están ubicados y cómo llegar?</span><span class=\"text-white/50 transition group-open:rotate-45 group-open:text-white\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/70\">Contamos con ubicación visible en Google Maps dentro del sitio. Desde allí puedes abrir la ruta directamente para llegar a nuestra sede.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/60 px-5 py-4 transition duration-300 open:border-white/25\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-lg font-light text-white/90 marker:content-none\"><span>¿Qué incluye el acompañamiento post-venta?</span><span class=\"text-white/50 transition group-open:rotate-45 group-open:text-white\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.02em] text-white/70\">Seguimiento de entrega, orientación operativa inicial y canal de soporte para resolver dudas técnicas o administrativas relacionadas al proceso.</p></details></div></div></section><section id=\"contacto\" class=\"bg-black px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 sm:text-sm\">Contacto</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[0.05em] text-white sm:text-5xl\">Conecta con San Mérida<br/>por el canal que prefieras.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base font-light leading-8 tracking-[0.03em] text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Atención comercial, soporte y redes oficiales en un solo lugar para brindarte respuesta rápida y profesional.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_0.9fr]\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">Contacto general</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-white/65\">Escríbenos para asesoría comercial, planes y disponibilidad de modelos.</p><form class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Nombre\" autoComplete=\"name\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 px-4 py-3 text-white placeholder:text-white/35 outline-none transition focus:border-white/30\" value=\"\"/><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 px-4 py-3 text-white placeholder:text-white/35 outline-none transition focus:border-white/30\" value=\"\"/><textarea rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Mensaje\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full resize-none rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 px-4 py-3 text-white placeholder:text-white/35 outline-none transition focus:border-white/30\"></textarea><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-2\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-black transition hover:bg-white/90\">Enviar mensaje</button><a href=\"https://wa.me/584140000000?text=Hola%20San%20M%C3%A9rida%2C%20quiero%20informaci%C3%B3n%20de%20modelos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white/85 transition hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/5\">Ir a WhatsApp</a></div></form></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light text-white\">Canales directos</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-white/65\">Respuesta por teléfono, WhatsApp y redes oficiales.</p><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/584140000000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-4 py-3 transition hover:border-white/25\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/Whatsapp.png\"/><div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">WhatsApp</p><p class=\"text-white/85\">+58 414 000 0000</p></div></a><a href=\"tel:+584140000000\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-4 py-3 transition hover:border-white/25\"><img alt=\"Teléfono\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/Telefono.png\"/><div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Teléfono</p><p class=\"text-white/85\">+58 414 000 0000</p></div></a><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 p-4\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55\">Redes sociales</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-black/60 p-2.5 transition hover:border-white/30\"><img alt=\"Instagram\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/instagram.png\"/></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-black/60 p-2.5 transition hover:border-white/30\"><img alt=\"Facebook\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/facebook.png\"/></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-black/60 p-2.5 transition hover:border-white/30\"><img alt=\"TikTok\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/Tiktok.png\"/></a></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/65\">@sanmeridadejesuszambrano</p></div></div></article></div></div></section><footer class=\"bg-black px-6 pb-10 pt-16 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 border-t border-white/10 pt-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><div class=\"relative h-14 w-40\"><img alt=\"Logo San Mérida\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain object-left\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/Logo.png\"/></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-7 text-white/60\">Movilidad inteligente con enfoque profesional, procesos claros y respaldo real.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">Empresa</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-white/60\"><li><a href=\"#nosotros\" class=\"transition hover:text-white\">Nosotros</a></li><li><a href=\"#modelos\" class=\"transition hover:text-white\">Modelos</a></li><li><a href=\"#metodos-pago\" class=\"transition hover:text-white\">Métodos de pago</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">Soporte</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-white/60\"><li><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"transition hover:text-white\">Preguntas frecuentes</a></li><li><a href=\"#ubicacion\" class=\"transition hover:text-white\">Ubicación</a></li><li><a href=\"#contacto\" class=\"transition hover:text-white\">Contacto</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">Síguenos</h3><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-black/60 p-2.5 transition hover:border-white/30\"><img alt=\"Instagram\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/instagram.png\"/></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-black/60 p-2.5 transition hover:border-white/30\"><i